msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02A77B9B_FC1E_472A_A6ED_32B97CFF6F3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Riding the moonlight’s current, his hand fell against my cheek.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was much colder "
"than I had expected,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫月明かりに導かれるように、⟪k:1⟫彼の手がわたしの頬に触れる。⟪k:2⟫びっくりするほど、⟪k:3⟫その手"
"はひんやりとしていたけれど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E05F5ED4_80BB_4F67_9BDF_F9C180B1D998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ffe4af5932b79195651eaec62cda07fc1409de92e5d0845152b26010e20daab
