msgid "⟪k:0⟫He brought his head in. ⟪k:1⟫I closed my eyes, and—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼の顔が近づく。⟪k:1⟫わたしは目を細めて、⟪k:2⟫そして―――"

